    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="17">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 17</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="17" corresp="#wit-g-a"><pb n="296" ed="#liebermann"/>And we forbeodað ordal ⁊ aðas freolsdagum ⁊ ymbrendagum ⁊ lengctendagum<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="18" target="#ICn_17.lnote.oe.18"/> ⁊ rihtfæstendagum ⁊ fra<hi rend="italic">m</hi> Aduentum D<hi rend="italic">omi</hi>ni oð se eahtaþa<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="19" target="#ICn_17.lnote.oe.19"/> dæg agán sig<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="3" target="#ICn_17.lnote.oe.3"/> ofer Twelftan<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="20" target="#ICn_17.lnote.oe.20"/> mæssedæge ⁊ fram Septuagessima<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="21" target="#ICn_17.lnote.oe.21"/> oð XV<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="22" target="#ICn_17.lnote.oe.22"/> nihton ofer Eastron.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="17" corresp="#wit-b"><pb n="296" ed="#liebermann"/>We forbeodað ordal ⁊ aðas freolsdagum ⁊ ymbrendagum ⁊ lenctendagu<hi rend="italic">m<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="6" target="#ICn_17.lnote.oe.6"/></hi> ⁊ fram Aduentu<hi rend="italic">m</hi> D<hi rend="italic">omi</hi>ni oððe<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="5" target="#ICn_17.lnote.oe.5-2"/> se eahteoða dæg agán sy ofer Twelftadæg ⁊ fram Septuagessima oþþe<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="5" target="#ICn_17.lnote.oe.5-2"/> fiftyne niht ofer Eastron.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="17" corresp="#wit-a"><pb n="296" ed="#liebermann"/>And we forbeodað ordal ⁊ aðas freolsdagum ⁊ ymbrendagum ⁊ le[n]ctendagum<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="2" target="#ICn_17.lnote.oe.2"/> ⁊ rihtfæstendagu<hi rend="italic">m</hi> ⁊ fram Aduentum D<hi rend="italic">omi</hi>ni oð se eahteðe dæg agan sy ofer Twelftadæg ⁊ fram Septuagesima oð fiftene niht ofer Eastran.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="17" corresp="#wit-q"><pb n="297" ed="#liebermann"/>Et festis diebus iuramenta et ferri uel aquę uel huiusmodi legis iudicia<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="9" target="#ICn_17.lnote.oe.9"/> (examina) fieri prohibemus et Quatuor temporum et diebus Quadragesimę et aliis legitimis<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="10" target="#ICn_17.lnote.oe.10"/> ieiuniis et ab Aduentu Domini usque in octauum diem post duodecimum<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="11" target="#ICn_17.lnote.oe.11"/> á Natali et á Septuagesima usque ad<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="12" target="#ICn_17.lnote.oe.12"/> XV dies post Pascha.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="17" corresp="#wit-inst-cn"><pb n="297" ed="#liebermann"/>In omnibus festis et diebus ieiuniorum et diebus Quadragesimę et ab Aduentu Domini usque<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="11" target="#ICn_17.lnote.oe.11-2"/> octo dies post octauas Epiphanię et a<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="12" target="#ICn_17.lnote.oe.12-2"/> Septuagesima usque quindecim dies post Pasca omnia iudicia ferri et aquę et omne iusiurandum ex parte Dei prohibemus.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="17" corresp="#wit-cons-cn"><pb n="297" ed="#liebermann"/>[17] Interdicimus etiam iudicialem probacionem et iuraiuranda festis et constitutis ieiuniis et ab Aduentu Domini usque ad octauam Epiphanie et a Septuagesima usque ad quintam decimam diem post diem Dominice resurrectionis.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="17" corresp="#wit-b"><pb n="166" ed="#robertson"/>We forbeodað ordal ⁊ aðas freolsdagum ⁊ ymbrendagum ⁊ lenctendagum [⁊ rihtfæstendagum]<ptr type="editorNote" n="16" target="#ICn_17.robnote.fn.16"/> ⁊ fram Aduentum Domini oð(ðe)<ptr type="editorNote" n="17" target="#ICn_17.robnote.fn.17"/> se eahteoða dæg agán sy ofer Twelftadæg<ptr type="editorNote" n="18" target="#ICn_17.robnote.fn.18"/> ⁊ fram Septuagessima oþ(þe)<ptr type="editorNote" n="17" target="#ICn_17.robnote.fn.17"/> fiftyne niht ofer Eastron.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-g-a"><pb n="246" ed="#rabin-doml"/>And we forbeodað ordal and aðas freolsdagum and ymbrendagum and lengctendagum and rihtfæstendagum and fram Aduentum Domini oð se eahtaþa dæg agan sig ofer Twelftan mæssedæge and fram Septuagessima oð XV nihton ofer Eastron.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann"><pb n="297" ed="#liebermann"/>Und<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="1" target="#ICn_17.lnote.de.1"/> wir verbieten Ordal und [gerichtliche] Eide<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="2" target="#ICn_17.lnote.de.2"/> an Feiertagen und Quatembertagen und Frühlingsfastentagen und Tagen gesetzlichen Fastens und von Adventus Domini bis der<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="3" target="#ICn_17.lnote.de.3"/> achte Tag [13. Januar] über den Zwölften-Festtag<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="4" target="#ICn_17.lnote.de.4"/> vergangen ist und von Septuagesima bis 14 Tage nach Ostern.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And we forbid ordeals and [judicial] oaths on feast-days and Ember days and Lenten days and days of lawful fasting, and from Advent until the eighth day [13 January] after Twelfth Day has passed, and from Septuagesima until a fortnight after Easter.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-b"><ptr type="editorNote" n="1" target="#ICn_17.robnote.n.1"/><pb n="167" ed="#robertson"/>And we forbid ordeals and oaths during festivals and the Ember Days and days in Lent, and on legally appointed fast days, and from the Advent till the eighth day after Twelfth Night, and from the Septuagesima till fifteen days after Easter.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-g-a"><pb n="247" ed="#rabin-doml"/>And we forbid ordeals and oaths on feasts and Ember Days, during Lent, on legally designated fast days, from Advent until the eighth day after Twelfth Night, and from Septuagesima until fifteen days after Easter.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="297"><ref target="clause:VIAtr_25">VI Atr 25</ref>; <ref target="clause:EGu_9">EGu 9</ref></note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">ebd. 25 | (* E Gu. 9)</note>
        <note type="comparison" source="#wormald-mel" n="357"><label>source (roman)</label> <ref target="clause:EGu_9">EGu 9</ref> <quote>Table 5.4, I Cn 17: Cn 1018 15  VI Atr 25, EGu 9 (Can.Eg. 24)</quote></note>
        <note type="comparison" source="#wormald-mel" n="357"><label>source (roman)</label> <ref target="clause:VIAtr_25">VI Atr 25</ref> <quote>Table 5.4, I Cn 17: Cn 1018 15  VI Atr 25, EGu 9 (Can.Eg. 24)</quote></note>
        <note type="comparison" source="#wormald-mel" n="357"><label>quoted verbatim (bold in Wormald's table)</label> <ref target="clause:Cn-1018_part-046">Cn 1018 15</ref> <quote>Table 5.4, I Cn 17: Cn 1018 15  VI Atr 25, EGu 9 (Can.Eg. 24)</quote></note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#kennedy" n="59"><label>used in I–II Cnut</label> <ref target="clause:Cn-1018_part-046">Cn 1018 15–15.2</ref> <quote>Kennedy’s table: VI Æthelred 25–25.2 | D 15–15.2 | I Cnut 17, I Cnut 17.2, I Cnut 17.3</quote></note>
        <note type="editorial">B's ‘oðþe’ (twice) should be ‘oð þæt’; Liebermann supplies two words in B from the other MSS. Liebermann compares VI Atr 25; EGu 9.; Robertson (p. 139) takes I Cn from B, which begins at ‘mæssedæg’ in 14.2, the earlier clauses being supplied from G; BR: added from Gesetze I p. 297, October 2026 (MS Cons)</note>
        <note type="textual" source="#rabin-doml">And: omitted B</note>
        <note type="textual" source="#rabin-doml">and rihtfæstendagum: omitted B</note>
        <note type="textual" source="#rabin-doml">Twelftan mæssedæge: Twelftadæg AB</note>
